aggable UI: Every element is freely movable\n\n📁 Templates: One-click GUI kits (Login screen, more coming soon!)\n\n💾 Save/Load: Save your GUI layout to GuiMakerLayout.json\n\n📋 Export: Copy your GUI as Lua code, ready to use anywhere\n\n🎞 Animations: Hover effects and tween support included\n\n🛡 Key System: Optional unlock with key & webhook support\n\n\n\n---\n\n🧠 How to Use:\n\n1. Run the script in your executor (key unlock required)\n\n\n2. Use the right-side toolbar to:\n\nAdd elements ➕\n\nMove & group them freely 🖱\n\nSave or load layouts 💾\n\nExport to Lua code 📤\n\n\n\n3. Share your .json or code with others!\n\n\n\n\n---\n\n💡 Perfect for:\n\nUI designers\n\nScript devs\n\nShowcase creators\n\nCustom executor UIs\n\nComment for a update suggestions","tags":["Gui","maker","script","key","free"],"discord":"","keyLink":"","owner":{"_id":"674d21a5fb053aa09937c219","username":"DoggoJ","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/945cb70a4270b1db0395a231c3d6ef62713d00aa5b1f7413ad89487ff2ecfcd8.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/674d21a5fb053aa09937c219-1757315811450.jpg"},"lvl":10,"status":"offline","id":"674d21a5fb053aa09937c219","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.scripts","tier":10},"profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/945cb70a4270b1db0395a231c3d6ef62713d00aa5b1f7413ad89487ff2ecfcd8.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/674d21a5fb053aa09937c219-1757315811450.jpg"}},"reviewed":null,"liked":false,"disliked":false,"cstatus":{"verdict":"none","pct":null,"conf":0,"n":{"w":0,"b":0,"p":0,"d":0,"k":0},"total":0,"detected":false,"key":false,"recent":0,"at":"2026-10-19T22:53:21.655Z","last":"","win":14,"math":3},"isHub":false,"supportedGames":[],"changelog":[{"_id":"686a158bbfaa36c66e390a6c","editBy":{"_id":"674d21a5fb053aa09937c219","username":"DoggoJ","status":"offline","id":"674d21a5fb053aa09937c219"},"message":"Create script","createdAt":"2025-07-06T06:19:55.173Z"},{"_id":"686a164b0fc69c3ddf2bf4e2","editBy":{"_